L3 support for Launcher, approved by Oracle DM e67a24a8-ae6c-4375-8ec4-ce8318099a2d.

Shadow::Positioned {offset, blur, color} resolves to the existing L1 shadow parameters; Custom still resolves offset [0,0]. Offset must be finite, blur nonnegative/finite, colour within 0..1. No default preset, shader or dependency changed.

